   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: All offerings «can become» indistinguishably «intermingled» with each other, except for a sin offering and a guilt offering. The Gemara asks: «What is different» about «a sin offering and a guilt offering,» that they cannot become intermingled? Is the reason «that this,» a guilt offering, is always «a male, and that,» a sin offering, is always «a female?»"
